# Agent chat components

Canonical doc: `docs/ui-rules/agent-components.md`. Registry: `component-registry.md` (Agent / AI).

## Message list

Use `AgentMessageList` + types from `@/components/agent/types`. Roles: `user`, `assistant`, `tool`, `confirmation`, `card`.

Assistant prose: `StructuredContent` (wraps `FormattedText` + `<oct-*>` blocks). Maps: `extractGoogleMapsUrls` + `GoogleMapsPreviewButton`.

Backend UI on messages: `AgentMessage.ui` → `ChatUIComponent`. Page context: `AgentPageContextProvider` + `useRegisterAgentPageContext`.

Structured results: `role: 'card'` + `AgentCardPayload` → `renderAgentCard()` from `@/components/agent/cards`.

Tool UI payloads from backend: `ChatUIComponent` from `@/components/agent/UIComponentRegistry`.

