## Shell

- Empty thread: `AgentWelcomeScreen`
- Loading: `AgentThinkingIndicator`
- Attachments: `AgentFileAttachmentChip`; preview: `ChatFilePreviewDialog`
- Editable title: `EditableConversationTitle`
- Voice: `VoiceRecorder` + `RecordingBar`
- Side panel: `ContentPanel`
- Header settings: `AgentSettingsPopover`
- Context: `ContextUsageIndicator`
- Mobile page layout: `MobileAgentLayout`

## Rules

- Icons from `@/lib/icons` only.
- No nested `SectionCard` in agent cards.
- No `Select` in agent settings — `RadioGroupField` + `Switch`.
- Extend `AgentCardPayload` + registry aliases — do not invent parallel card shapes per module.
